      "title": "Data centres in Andaman & Nicobar: why did island administration withdraw its own proposal?",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/andaman-and-nicobar-islands/andaman-nicobar-admin-issues-call-for-interest-for-data-centre-exploration-withdraws-it-days-later-explained/article71372364.ece",
      "description": "On Great Nicobar Island, local Nicobarese communities are already opposing the Union government’s ₹91,000-crore mega-infrastructure project that involves building an airport, a transshipment port, and a tourism-led township",
      "source_name": "The Hindu National",
      "published": "2026-08-21T08:31:21"
